{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "18712734a1647547745fb993e16da2fee2f5624861d84e72f4b5edfc8a8c171e", "ja": "（新作のドラマに合わせて、新しい衣装ができた。\n今日のライブでお披露目だけど、育の様子は……）", "zh": "（配合新电视剧制作的新服装完成了。\n今天会在演唱会上首次亮相，育的状况怎么样呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "7c30e51bd2a71c3a3be60f0461aa5f47edd8bc919ee2a3b5da2c8069e5db1d11", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　\nどう？　新しい衣装、似合ってるかな？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n怎么样？新服装好看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c05bade8025a83651a6dd3476d7464048605c876d11a855bfd895540e4bb4530", "ja": "ああ、よく似合ってるよ。これなら\nファンのみんなも、喜んでくれるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "嗯，很好看喔！\n这下粉丝们应该也会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "847223dc4765df72348c34c438ea4a8610cb4f1e1703ff973d586389ffcd7523", "ja": "ほんとう？　よかった～！　今日のライブでは、\nみんなにもちゃんと、見てもらえるよね！", "zh": "真的？太好了～！\n今天演唱会上就可以让大家仔细欣赏了，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "17ebc6c9689f20f39afd239aada6c77c4190ecac02faae3db1b01ce2674b61d4", "ja": "せっかくかわいい衣装なのに、撮影だとわたし、\n戦ってるシーンばっかりだったから。", "zh": "因为，我明明难得穿上这么可爱的服装，\n拍摄时却每次都是打斗场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1005_p", "source_sha256": "81191c6c0441335c3907edbbcdde65e8e1819fbfb005c2274fd178abe94df498", "ja": "確かに、育のキャラクターは\nみんながピンチの場面で変身したからな……。", "zh": "的确如此，\n毕竟育的角色是在大家陷入危机时才变身的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1006_p", "source_sha256": "620e0ed3908a08ab1ca31d7967dc62a8c0c346e674e80f32f86ebc40db3336ec", "ja": "でも、桃子の友達のゴーレム役は\n育に似合ってたし、すごくよかったと思うよ。", "zh": "不过，桃子的朋友──魔像这个角色\n很适合育，我觉得很棒喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "be60738015172ba7de1fbd5ab2b5746fb879d4c01a8cf995630a92ae767c59b4", "ja": "ゴーレム……うーん……。", "zh": "魔像……唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f30d7662d27dfc8e8f71c729d2f1fb4981b88b0789cd683bee025c1ec9dda1e5", "ja": "育、何か不満があるのか？", "zh": "育，你有哪里不满意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "53a61d93dc714dab34ce421443206b7f481debcf4a2407f56921d46e6b0d02e2", "ja": "だって。桃子ちゃんのお友達役なのは\nうれしかったけど、わたし、ゴーレムなんだもん。", "zh": "你看嘛～虽然扮演桃子的朋友让我很高兴，\n但我竟然是演魔像耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "ad9da982bb537cd9c481815b289c0021d56840f4186db4d82ba960c9d6d182c1", "ja": "{$P$}さんも見たでしょ？\n女神さまになる前のゴーレム……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也看到了吧？\n变成女神前的魔像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e16f678f9e895eb693089a6c31fcb9f5100f00be1eac80927508e141e860d58a", "ja": "ああ、うん。けど、あれはあれで\n愛嬌があって良かったと思うけど……。", "zh": "嗯，看到了。\n不过我觉得，那样也有它的可爱之处……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "0424a8d8a9249404463c83a0351855f90f3a72eaf74209222be1aef900685f26", "ja": "もう！　{$P$}さん、\nちっともわかってないんだから。", "zh": "讨厌啦！{$P$}先生，\n你真是一点都不懂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "5f8d70276b1f0e57f402d7829777a5dbaf4bdfafc47104eee61a7109e577bd61", "ja": "わたしが好きなアニメのヒロインは、\nみんなステキな衣装を着てるんだよ？", "zh": "我爱看的动画中，\n每位女主角可都是穿着漂亮的服装喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "c4a5db1f2e9e7e3929bbe428135aa109533b06276a323d53663099b19af40387", "ja": "やっとゴーレムから女神さまになったのに、\n最後は元にもどっちゃうし……。", "zh": "好不容易能从魔像变成女神了，\n结果最后又恢复原状……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8cce62c80a0c96760d9243b674d9f7ad3db1393dc9997fb3d0904a9b5e0b1df8", "ja": "まあまあ……ヒロインにも色んなタイプがいるんだよ。\n育が演じたヒロインは、普段はゴーレムだけど……。", "zh": "别这么说嘛……女主角也是有很多类型啊。\n育扮演的女主角，虽然平时是魔像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4274a677eda31aa93333e37c099e50e0c94fad9287783b8c5bfef49efcf28ad3", "ja": "友達の力で、女神さまにもなれる。大切な\n仲間を守ることもできる。とても素敵だと思うよ。", "zh": "但可以透过朋友的力量变成女神，\n还能保护重要的伙伴，我觉得非常出色又美丽喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "72d3aef4e425609ffe38510cf3ad5d613c1b6f74d8f8aff45e91993b3330cd31", "ja": "{$P$}さん……ほんとう？\nわたし、ちゃんとステキな女神さまになれてた？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……真的吗？\n我真的有变成美丽的女神吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_1018", "source_sha256": "d7dc2c584dab1c79c1051244bd1990da52c55f4f5fffd94bd0097c76a51bd1ca", "ja": "もちろん！", "zh": "那当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_2000_p", "source_sha256": "f84a59209c558a0332d43b26ac9d82c205c5d06f88af7ba97ecad201dfa33b2b", "ja": "素敵な女神さまに見えるよ。きっとファンのみんなも、\nいつもより大人っぽくて素敵だと思うんじゃないかな？", "zh": "看起来是位相当美丽的女神喔。\n粉丝们肯定也会觉得你比平常成熟漂亮吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_2001_030iku", "source_sha256": "68a1e0c09db45a7f9c3c9b9d3f5dadad72733c075deff71886ccfa7097ae64ed", "ja": "わたし、いつもより大人っぽく見えるんだ？\n……それなら、いいかな？　えへへ♪", "zh": "原来我看起来比平常成熟啊。\n……这样的话我就可以接受了，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_2002_030iku", "source_sha256": "6b51bea9f1f967220abb4bb3ab90ff0dd7a6755a9543bd859f05c9364c01f526", "ja": "ねえ{$P$}さん、あとは？\n他には何ができたら、もっと大人っぽいと思う？", "zh": "欸，{$P$}先生，其他的呢？\n你觉得还要会些什么，看起来才会更成熟呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_2003_p", "source_sha256": "c25bd178dadee30c312d473dcb2a1d0f73becc87059dc42b62c37d8eb80e70b2", "ja": "あとは……そうだな。ライブにきてくれたみんなに、\n楽しい気持ちをプレゼントできたら、最高かな！", "zh": "其他的嘛……对了，如果能将欢乐带给\n来看演唱会的所有人，应该就无可挑剔了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_2004_030iku", "source_sha256": "0f18a4f1287827b4537ad90719ff27e5d60e13d76f089b3a4444be26e90bd17f", "ja": "それなら、まかせて！　わたし、みんなを\n楽しい気持ちにするの、得意だもん♪", "zh": "这个包在我身上！\n毕竟我很擅长带给大家欢乐嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_2005_030iku", "source_sha256": "f64bcb080e59f4d8c6887d1fdc2967b75d2dd43514086ddbe8fdc0b76de9ff4a", "ja": "あっ、そろそろ時間だね。それじゃあ\n{$P$}さん、いってくるね！", "zh": "啊，时间差不多了。\n那{$P$}先生，我先过去啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0154_2006_p", "source_sha256": "48e09600529e5fc57c676c3147e318249c7c761931a6a2ea47c7d232b546f6da", "ja": "（その後のライブは、大盛り上がり！　育の\n女神役にちなんで『神公演』と大好評だった……）", "zh": "（之后的演唱会嗨到最高点，大受好评！\n还因为育饰演的是女神，而被誉为『神公演』……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
